  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Unguwa Uku Women Rice Processing Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project includes a capacity building component in which members would be trained on modern rice production and processing in addition to business management and organizational skills. The Cooperative will produce rice on a 10ha farmland in addition to the 10ha to be produced by members. The Cooperative will also establish 2-ton capacity rice processing and milling facility.</narrative>
  </description>
